---
import DuckScene from "../three/DuckScene";
---

<section id="top" class="relative flex min-h-svh flex-col overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Ambient glow + giant watermark behind the 3D scene. -->
  <div
    class="glow top-1/4 left-1/2 h-[42rem] w-[42rem] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/4"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="ghost-title absolute top-16 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 md:top-10"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    QUACK-1
  </div>

  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <DuckScene client:only="react" />
  </div>

  <div
    class="pointer-events-none relative z-10 mx-auto flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-1 flex-col justify-end px-6 pb-16"
  >
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4" data-reveal>为 bug 而生 · 为桌面而造</p>
    <h1 class="h-hero max-w-4xl" data-reveal>
      全世界最没必要<br />这么精致的<span class="text-accent">橡皮鸭</span>。
    </h1>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6" data-reveal>
      <p class="max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream-dim">
        它会倾听,会漂浮,会以恰到好处的方式审视你的代码。QUACK
        让最孤独的调试时刻,也像经过了同行评审。
      </p>
      <a href="#model" class="btn-ghost pointer-events-auto">认识 QUACK-1</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="scrim pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-40"></div>

  <!-- Scroll cue -->
  <div
    class="absolute bottom-6 left-1/2 z-10 -translate-x-1/2 animate-bounce font-mono text-xs tracking-[0.3em] text-cream-dim"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
    ↓
  </div>
</section>
